country - Country Name
child_mort - Infant mortality per 1,000 births
exports; - Export Level (percentage of GDP)
health - Health Investment (percentage of GDP)
imports - Import Level (percentage of GDP)
income - Average income per capita
inflation - Inflation
life_expec - Life expectancy in years
total_fer - Total number of children each woman could have given birth to if the fertility rate remained the same
gdpp - GDP per capita (country’s GDP divided by population)
income_category - Country category based on income